[options]
[A.]
                                              <h2>SACRIFICE!  <a href="#mission25">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
                                          ~[IsunAviary.31]
<br>
This is it, it's do or die time! The Final Confrontation is here!
<p>
Knowing that you are heavily outnumbered and outgunned, seven of your top
Lieutenants have come forth to you, and have volunteered their life for the
chance that with their Sacrifice, a gift will be granted to you. Despite your
protests, they demand that you pick one of them and sacrifice them, so you may
finally destroy the evil ~rHADES~..
<br>

$Button=More,Tell,A2

[A2]
                                          <h2>SACRIFICE!  <a href="#mission25">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
                                      ~[IsunAviary.31]
<br>
However, you have heard rumors that the {sw_god5} has twisted the will of a few
of these once good men. You don't know which ones are spies and which are your
true allies - for to be bestowed a grand gift, it requires a pure and honest
soul!
<p>
You pace the ground in front of these brave men... How can you condemn one to their
death? And what if it's one of ~rHADES~. tortured puppets? What evil will be unleashed?
<p>
You can't wait any longer. You must pick. You just wish that it was you to be sacrificed,
and not one of these brave Priests.
<p>
                  <a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55"> ~[IfortGump.50] </a>                            <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">~[IfortGump.22] </a>                     <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">~[Ipriest.13]</a><br>
        <a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55">Review Knowledge</a>      <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">    Let's Do It!   </a>      <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">Leave HELL</a>

$OnExit= ,PlaySound,priestMove1.wav
$Button= ,Tell,A.
[@5]
You only have a few minutes to sacrifice one priest. If you do not, then the final battle
will start, without any special abilities you may recieve (note: the final battle is extremely
tough! You need all the help you can get!
$Button=OK I'll sacrifice,DoNothing,0

[@60]
You have 2 minutes left....
$Button=OK I'll sacrifice,DoNothing,0
[@120]
One minute. You'd better hurry!
$Button=OK I'll sacrifice,DoNothing,0
[@180]
<$MissionBegin,sw_m25a>

[ai2PriestCaptured][ai3PriestCaptured][ai4PriestCaptured][ai5PriestCaptured][ai6PriestCaptured][ai7PriestCaptured][ai8PriestCaptured]
<$PlaySound,forStorm2.wav>
The priest bravely climbs onto your Sail Skater and awaits his doom..
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0


[ai2PriestDead]
<$PlaySound,TreasonCast.wav>
Who Hoo. You have been given a gift of Treason! When the battle starts, a number
of enemy weapons will be miraculously transformed to your weapons!
<p>
This priest, and your friend, did not die in vain! With his sacrifice, he may have
paved the way for all of Nimbus' victory!
<$Config,sw_mvar2=1>
$Button=Lets battle!,MissionBegin,sw_m25a

[ai3PriestDead]
<$PlaySound,paralysisCast.wav>
You have been granted the power to slow your enemies! When the battle starts, the enemies
will move much slower than they normally would have!
<p>
This priest, and your friend, did not die in vain! With his sacrifice, he may have
paved the way for all of Nimbus' victory!
<$Config,sw_mvar3=6>
<$Config,sw_mvar9=1>
$Button=Lets battle!,MissionBegin,sw_m25a

[ai4PriestDead]
<$PlaySound,devastationCast.wav>
You have been granted the power of mass destruction! When the battle starts, a number of the enemies
weapons will be severely damage! 
<p>
This priest, and your friend, did not die in vain! With his sacrifice, he may have
paved the way for all of Nimbus' victory!
<$Config,sw_mvar4=1>
$Button=Lets battle!,MissionBegin,sw_m25a

[ai5PriestDead]
<$PlaySound,decimationCast.wav>
You have been granted the power of destruction! When the battle starts, a number of the enemies
weapons will be destroyed! 
<p>
This priest, and your friend, did not die in vain! With his sacrifice, he may have
paved the way for all of Nimbus' victory!
<$Config,sw_mvar5=1>
$Button=Lets battle!,MissionBegin,sw_m25a

[ai6PriestDead]
<$PlaySound,bell.wav>
Storm Crystals pour down from the heavens, as you recieve this gift. It is as if the
Gods wept because an innocent and pure life was sacrificed. 
<p>
This priest, and your friend, did not die in vain! With his sacrifice, he may have
paved the way for all of Nimbus' victory!
<$Config,sw_mvar6=1>
$Button=Lets battle!,MissionBegin,sw_m25a

[ai7PriestDead]
<$PlaySound,priestSacrifice4.wav>
Oh no! This soul was not pure, and was corrupted by {sw_hades}! You wonder what
 evil has been unleashed because of this!
<p>
This poor twisted shell of a once mighty and benevolant priest, is now in {sw_hades}
 realm, being tortured unmercifully.
<$Config,sw_mvar7=1>
$Button=Lets battle!,MissionBegin,sw_m25a

[ai8PriestDead]
<$PlaySound,priestSacrifice4.wav>
Oh no! This soul was not pure, and was corrupted by {sw_hades}! You wonder what
 evil has been unleashed because of this!
<p>
This poor twisted shell of a once mighty and benevolant priest, is now in {sw_hades}
 realm, being tortured unmercifully.
<$Config,sw_mvar8=1>
$Button=Lets battle!,MissionBegin,sw_m25a


